  "description": "Persist a notification from the upstream feed and derive its canonical subject link. An ordinary subject stores its own url verbatim; a repository-invitation subject (whose own url is null) stores a link derived from the repository's public web url with an invitations path appended. The stored subject type and link of the most recently stored notification are reported.",
